OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgent' plea for help to increase
OL,4,Anumber of trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteer wardens are being sought
OL,7,F"urgently" to help bring the tree cover
OL,8,Fin a town up to the national average.
OL,10,FAccording to the Woodland Trust,
OL,11,FSwindon has an average tree cover of
OL,12,Fjust 8%, compared with the urban
OL,13,FEngland average of 18%.
OL,15,FSwindon Borough councillor Jake
OL,16,FChandler said Wiltshire Wildlife Trust
OL,17,Fhad trained volunteer wardens to plant,
OL,18,Fmonitor and maintain their
OL,19,Fneighbourhood trees, but more people
OL,20,Fare needed to address a volunteer
OL,21,F"deficiency".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
