OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgent' plea for help to increase
OL,4,Anumber of trees
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We want Swindon to be the example
OL,7,F[for] other local authorities,
OL,8,Fespecially those urban population
OL,9,Fcentres where there just isn't the room
OL,10,Fto plant millions of trees next to each
OL,11,Fother," he said.
